export const content = "<h1>First Skydiving Experience</h1>\n<p>After doing the <a href=\"https://whoisfelix.com/worlds-highest-bungee/\">highest bungee jump in the world</a> in Macau, I want to do something more daring and what could it possibly be other than the adrenaline rush and heart-stopping skydiving!!!!! It was one of the highlights of my tour that time.</p>\n<p>For the whole video, click <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/felixnoriel/videos/10205150121812310/?permPage=1\">this</a></p>\n<p>I chose <a href=\"http://tandemcairns.com.au/\">Tandem Cairns</a> for my first Skydiving. This was the cheapest with good reviews based on my research and I booked this before going to Cairns, so there&#8217;s no turning back!</p>\n<p>And so the day came and I was ready for it. Bring it on!</p>\n<p>We went to the skydiving site, registered and gave us instructions. I&#8217;m on the last batch and have to wait for the first batches to finish first.</p>\n<p>I noticed there are two batches of skydiving instructors, they take turns every flight. So when it&#8217;s my turn, I guess my instructor was already tired. I just hope he doesn&#8217;t forget to pull out the parachute in time! Haha.</p>\n<h3>Waiting time&#8230;</h3>\n<p>the worst feeling I had. Just thinking whether you&#8217;ll still be alive after this or not. Haha just kidding.</p>\n<p>After waiting for few hours, it&#8217;s now our turn to skydive! I&#8217;m so excited and a bit nervous.</p>\n<p>They first interview me for the video compilation purposes..</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-785 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9813-15.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"811\" height=\"457\" /></p>\n<p>On my way to the plane..</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-763 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9814-0.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"806\" height=\"454\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-764 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9815-3.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"803\" height=\"453\" /></p>\n<p>This is what it looks like inside the plane..</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-766 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9816-27.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"806\" height=\"454\" /></p>\n<p>This is my partner, he&#8217;s in charge of my life at this time.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-765 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9816-3.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"810\" height=\"456\" /></p>\n<p>I was already feeling a bit nervous this time. I can already see that we&#8217;re already high above the ground.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-767 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9817-0.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"811\" height=\"457\" /></p>\n<p>I can already see clouds. Oh my, I&#8217;m about to piss my pants off!</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-769 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9818-21.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"811\" height=\"457\" /></p>\n<p>My instructor told me that we&#8217;re only half way through. I just laughed off the nervous feeling building inside me.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-770 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9819-21.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"804\" height=\"453\" /></p>\n<p>Okay, they&#8217;re telling us to get ready because we&#8217;re almost there. I now got my serious trying not to piss or shit my pants off face.</p>\n<p>At this time, If I remember it correctly, I was about to tell my instructor that I&#8217;m backing off, but then I thought I will look like a fool if I did. So what the hell, let&#8217;s do this!</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-771 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9821-0.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"802\" height=\"452\" /></p>\n<p>There comes the first diver. OMG the transition was like only 5 seconds for the next one to go after.<br />\nAlright, We&#8217;ll be the third one to jump. I&#8217;m ready!</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-772 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9821-20.500-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"802\" height=\"452\" /></p>\n<h3>The Dive</h3>\n<p>And it all comes to this.. I can&#8217;t feel anything by this time. Just my heartbeat pumping really hard.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-773 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9821-29.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"795\" height=\"448\" /></p>\n<p>And there we go..</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-775 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9821-31.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"793\" height=\"447\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-774 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9821-30.500-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"786\" height=\"443\" /></p>\n<p>For few seconds, my heart stopped.</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-776 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9821-33.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"785\" height=\"442\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-777 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9821-35.500-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"784\" height=\"442\" /></p>\n<p>How awesome is that!</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-778 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9821-69.500-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"783\" height=\"441\" /></p>\n<p>After around 45 seconds of having adrenaline rush from the free fall, the parachute pops out..</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-779 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9821-80.500-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"779\" height=\"439\" /></p>\n<p>I was supposed to land at the beach side but there were no slots left for that jump. But hey, this view is still an awesome view!</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-780 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9822-0.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"780\" height=\"439\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-782 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9822-24.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"781\" height=\"440\" /></p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-783 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9823-33.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"783\" height=\"441\" /></p>\n<h3>The aftermath</h3>\n<p>After the skydive, I could not remember much of what happened and I had that adrenaline feeling vibrating through out my body for few minutes.</p>\n<p>I was really happy doing this challenge for myself and for the extraordinary experience.</p>\n<p>I&#8217;ll definitely going to do this again!</p>\n<p><img class=\"wp-image-784 aligncenter\" src=\"https://felixstatic.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2016/06/GOPR9824-12.000-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"skydiving cairns australia\" width=\"779\" height=\"439\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n"
